{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>\r\n\t\t\t埃及首都開羅附近一條高速公路發生嚴重車禍，最少10死24傷。<br/>\n<br/>\r\n衛生和人口部表示，事發在星期六，吉薩省有貨車與小型巴士相撞，造成多人傷亡，其中10人傷勢較重。<br/>\n<br/>\r\n當地傳媒報道，初步調查顯示，事故可能涉及大霧天氣下超速駕駛。<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\r\n編輯：盧曉珊\t\t</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-01T03:38:09.231001+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":116,"images":0,"source":"RTHK 國際","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-31T16:48:33+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-01T03:59:46.421222+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-01T03:31:14.664098+00:00","content_hash":"cd4d18a05e10b714915f32932635c8c021fbb3e3d45c15364bd4a2561c0ec096","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}